    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第二十二話　情海翻波，妄語如狂，虛實交織惹風浪"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "coffee corner。下午茶已經換上晚餐。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "qishan",
      "expr": "03-angry",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "就僅僅因為這樣，你就要聯同我一起，撒謊騙家綸他們了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "對。只有這樣，才能令家綸和素婷放心。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "qishan",
      "expr": "02-laugh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "你這個想法真是有夠神經病的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "那你是會幫忙的囉？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "qishan",
      "expr": "01-grin",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "喂，你是認真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "qishan",
      "expr": "04-loud",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "唉。怕了你啦。多年同學，你要發神經，我怎不跟你奉陪到底？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "素婷這邊也就罷了。你的芷君姐姐那邊又怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我到底還是親自走了一趟。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch22-bar"
    }
  ]
